2. Zen Browser
--------------

  https://zen-browser.app — https://github.com/zen-browser/desktop
  MPL-2.0

Mellow implements a client for Zen Browser's "spaces" Firefox Sync engine so that
spaces round-trip between Zen on the desktop and this browser on a phone. The data
model — spaces, folders, essentials, the vertical rail — follows Zen's.

No Zen Browser code is included in this repository. The sync client is an original
implementation written to match the record format and behaviour of Zen's engine,
so that both ends agree on the wire. Zen Browser has not reviewed, endorsed or
supported it.


